WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.001 --> 00:00:20.493
Tom Kitten was playing outside.

2
00:00:20.494 --> 00:00:24.335
"Time to clean up!" his mother called.

3
00:00:24.336 --> 00:00:33.111
"My friends are coming for tea later."

4
00:00:33.112 --> 00:00:38.747
Mrs. Twitchit washed Mittens' face.

5
00:00:38.748 --> 00:00:48.267
She brushed Moppet's fur.

6
00:00:48.268 --> 00:00:58.248
Then Mrs. Twitchit frowned.

7
00:00:58.249 --> 00:01:01.582
"Tom!" Mrs. Twitchit cried.

8
00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:09.701
"Come inside right now!"

9
00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:15.235
Mittens and Moppet put on pink dresses.

10
00:01:15.236 --> 00:01:21.377
Tom wore a clean shirt and new pants.

11
00:01:21.378 --> 00:01:26.657
Mrs. Twitchit looked around the room.

12
00:01:26.658 --> 00:01:32.658
"I need some pretty flowers," she said.

13
00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:35.742
Tom dashed outside.

14
00:01:35.743 --> 00:01:39.297
"I'll get some flowers!" he said.

15
00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:45.399
Mrs. Twitchit sighed.

16
00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:50.749
"Don't get dirty!" she said.

17
00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:55.337
Tom ran toward the pond.

18
00:01:55.338 --> 00:02:00.990
He didn't see any pretty flowers.

19
00:02:00.991 --> 00:02:05.551
But a frog sat on a boat.

20
00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:09.607
"I'm Jeremy Fisher," the frog said.

21
00:02:09.608 --> 00:02:13.762
"Can you help me find flowers?" Tom asked.

22
00:02:13.763 --> 00:02:16.726
"Yes," Jeremy said.

23
00:02:16.727 --> 00:02:19.532
"Can you help me find fish?"

24
00:02:19.533 --> 00:02:23.002
Tom looked down at his clean clothes.

25
00:02:23.003 --> 00:02:27.437
"I must not get wet," he thought.

26
00:02:27.438 --> 00:02:36.187
"But Mother needs flowers."

27
00:02:36.188 --> 00:02:42.336
Tom stepped into Jeremy's boat.

28
00:02:42.337 --> 00:02:46.242
Drip, drop.

29
00:02:46.243 --> 00:02:52.789
Suddenly it started to rain.
